From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:43:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mfd: apple,smc: Add the regulators node

The SMC switches supplies through function keys on A-series phones.
Allow the node that describes them.

Originally from iPhOmarchy patches/0040 ("input: apple_z2: D21 SMC function
rail control + iOS-order power cycle", b2533c59a2a0) and patches/0041
("input: apple_z2: D21 SMC rail-state probe (RW) + smc_on_retries",
b570c134309f), iPhOmarchy 5921728.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
index 16702250a..43cba6d8c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
@@ -59,6 +59,9 @@ properties:
   hwmon:
     $ref: /schemas/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml
 
+  regulators:
+    $ref: /schemas/regulator/apple,smc-regulators.yaml
+
 additionalProperties: false
 
 required:
